   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How would you use a position vs. time graph to construct a velocity vs. time graph and vice versa?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 998392,
     "content_html": "The slope of a position vs. time curve is used to construct a velocity vs. time curve, and the slope of a velocity vs. time curve is used to construct a position vs. time curve."
